ent-TelecomBus = telecommunication bus
    .desc = Carries signals between physically connected telecommunications machines.
ent-TelecomReceiver = telecommunication receiver
    .desc = Receives radio signals and passes them into the telecommunications network.
ent-TelecomProcessor = telecommunication processor
    .desc = Processes incoming radio signals before they are routed.
ent-TelecomBroadcaster = telecommunication broadcaster
    .desc = Broadcasts signals received from the telecommunication router.
ent-TelecomTrafficConsole = telecommunication traffic monitor
    .desc = Monitors telecommunication servers, signal logs, and routing status.
ent-OnyxTelecomServer = telecommunication server
    .desc = A telecommunications server that requires a receiver, processor, bus, and broadcaster chain.
